:: Fishing Beach Catch
<<if Weather.dayState is "day" and ($daily.fishing.fishingBeach.fisher.phase is "finished" or $daily.fishing.fishingBeach.fisher.phase is undefined) and $rng gte 92 and $daily.fishing.seagullSteal is undefined>>
	<<fishingSeagullCatch $fishingHookedFish $bus>>
<<elseif $daily.fishing.fishingBeach.fisher.phase is "fishing" and fishingHasMinutesPassedSinceNpcArrival(60) and $daily.fishing.fishingBeach.fisher.drunk gte 1 and $rng gte 80>>
	<<fishingBeachCatchFisherDrunk>>
<<elseif beachCampfirePartyPresent() and $rng gte 75 and $daily.fishing.fishingBeach.partyFeed is undefined and canCookFish($fishingHookedFish.type)>>
	<<fishingBeachCatchCampfireCook>>
<<else>>
	<<fishingBeachCatch>>
<</if>>


:: Widgets Fishing Beach Catch [widget]
<<widget "fishingBeachCatchFisherDrunk">>
	<<effects>>
	<<loadNPC 0 "fishing_beach_npc_fisher">><<person1>>

	The <<person>> stares at your catch for a moment, eyes narrowing. <<He>> straightens up unsteadily and takes a step toward you. "That one's mine, I had a line right there. Hand it over."
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Give <<him>> the fish|Fishing Beach Fisher Give Fish]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Refuse|Fishing Beach Fisher Give Fish Attack]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</widget>>


<<widget "fishingBeachCatchCampfireCook">>
	<<effects>>
	<<set _canEatFish to canEatFishTf($fishingHookedFish)>>
	<<set $daily.fishing.fishingBeach.partyFeed to "offering">>

	You hear cheers from the campfire. Someone calls out asking if you'll share the $fishingHookedFish.type so they can cook it for everyone.
	<br><br>

	<<if _canEatFish>>
		It's such a small fish, you could probably fit the whole thing in your mouth.
		<br><br>
	<</if>>

	<<if ($exposed is 1 and !hasSexStat("exhibitionism", 3)) or ($exposed gte 2 and !hasSexStat("exhibitionism", 5))>>
		<<insufficientStat "exhibitionism" "to walk over into the light of the campfire in such an exposed state">>
		<br>
	<<else>>
		<<link [[Have them cook the fish (0:15)|Beach Party Fish Cook]]>>
			<<pass 15>>
			<<set $daily.fishing.fishingBeach.partyFeed to "accepted">>

			/* The people around the campfire like you for doing this. So you shouldn't be assaulted at the campfire today */
			<<set $daily.fishing.safeFromBeachCampfireDanger to true>>
		<</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>

	<<link [["Stow the " + $fishingHookedFish.type + " away"|Fishing Beach Keep Party]]>>
		<<if baitShopWants($fishingHookedFish.type)>><<set $daily.fishing.baitShopRequest to "ready">><</if>>
		<<endevent>>
	<</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Throw it back|Fishing Beach Throw Back Party]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<if _canEatFish>>
		<<link [[Eat the fish|Fishing Beach Cat Eat Party]]>><</link>><<fishEatingTf>>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>


<<widget "fishingBeachCatch">>
	<<set _canEatFish to canEatFishTf($fishingHookedFish)>>

	<<if _canEatFish>>
		It's such a small fish, you could probably fit the whole thing in your mouth.
		<br><br>
	<</if>>

	<<link [["Stow the " + $fishingHookedFish.type + " away"|Fishing Beach Wait]]>>
		<<tending_give $fishingHookedFish.type 1>>
		<<set $fishingAmbientOverride to "stowAway">>
		<<if baitShopWants($fishingHookedFish.type)>><<set $daily.fishing.baitShopRequest to "ready">><</if>>
		<<endevent>>
	<</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Throw it back|Fishing Beach Wait]]>><<set $fishingAmbientOverride to "throwBack">><</link>>
	<<if _canEatFish>>
		<br>
		<<if $daily.fishing.fishingBeach.fisher.phase is "fishing">>
			<<link [[Eat the fish|Fishing Beach Cat Eat Fisher]]>><</link>><<fishEatingTf>>
		<<else>>
			<<link [[Eat the fish|Fishing Beach Cat Eat]]>><</link>><<fishEatingTf>>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>


:: Fishing Beach Cut
<<effects>>
You <span class="purple">cut</span> the line and the $fishingHookedFish.type swims away into the depths.
<br><br><br>

<<fishingMinigameResultUi $fishingMinigame.fishDistance "cut">>
<br><br>

<<unset $fishingHookedFish>>
<<run fishingMinigameEnd()>>
<<link [[Re-hook the line and cast back out (0:03)|Fishing Beach Wait]]>><<set $fishingAmbientOverride to "reHook">><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Leave|Beach]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>


:: Fishing Beach Snapped
Your line goes taut, then <span class="red">snaps.</span> The $fishingHookedFish.type is gone.
<br><br><br>

<<fishingMinigameResultUi $fishingMinigame.fishDistance "lineSnapped">>
<br><br>

<<unset $fishingHookedFish>>
<<run fishingMinigameEnd()>>
<<link [[Re-hook the line and cast back out (0:03)|Fishing Beach Wait]]>><<set $fishingAmbientOverride to "reHook">><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Leave|Beach]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>


:: Fishing Beach Fish Too Far
The $fishingHookedFish.type reaches the end of your line, works the hook loose, and is <span class="red">gone</span>.
<br><br><br>

<<fishingMinigameResultUi $fishingMinigame.fishDistance "fishOffHook">>
<br><br>

<<unset $fishingHookedFish>>
<<run fishingMinigameEnd()>>
<<link [[Re-hook the line and cast back out (0:03)|Fishing Beach Wait]]>><<set $fishingAmbientOverride to "reHook">><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Leave|Beach]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
